&lt;li&gt;Experience with optics and lasers, vacuum systems, cryogenic systems, electronics, control systems, or device packaging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Electrical test and characterization of devices at both die and package level, including at cryogenic temperatures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building test capability for new product introduction and transferring methods into a repeatable manufacturing workflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a startup or scale up environment.&lt;/li&gt;
