&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Non-Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Due to applicable export control laws and regulations, candidates must be a U.S. citizen or national, U.S. permanent resident (i.e., current Green Card holder), or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum. Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are interested in being a part of our team and mission, we encourage you to apply!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About IonQ:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2F&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=IonQ%2C+Inc&amp;amp;index=7&amp;amp;md5=0818ffbedc6dbad8c4d1611ac94c2a0f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;IonQ, Inc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;. [NYSE: IONQ] is the world’s leading quantum platform and merchant supplier - delivering integrated quantum solutions across computing, networking, sensing, and security. IonQ’s newest generation of quantum computers, the IonQ Tempo, is the latest in a line of cutting-edge systems that have been helping customers and partners including &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=Amazon+Web+Services%2C&amp;amp;index=8&amp;amp;md5=a7f94ee9b71a392dca3cd6c413722e51&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Amazon Web Services, &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=and&amp;amp;index=9&amp;amp;md5=2bed627b388878763f41ffe0e4edb16c&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;and &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=AstraZeneca&amp;amp;index=10&amp;amp;md5=757c1f2c2ec94cf3982700106122164f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AstraZeneca&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt; achieve 20x performance results and accelerate innovation in drug discovery, materials science, financial modeling, logistics, cybersecurity, and defense. In 2025, the company achieved 99.99% two-qubit gate fidelity, &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-achieves-landmark-result-setting-new-world-record-in-quantum-computing&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=setting+a+world+record+in+quantum+computing+performance&amp;amp;index=11&amp;amp;md5=32e9cb88afbd439026a352666cc72c91&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;setting a world record in quantum computing performance&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Headquartered in College Park, Maryland, IonQ has operations in California, Colorado, Massachusetts, Tennessee, Washington, Italy, South Korea, Sweden, Switzerland, Canada, and the United Kingdom. Our quantum computing services are available through all major cloud providers, while we also meet the needs of networking and sensing customers across land, sea, air, and space. IonQ is making quantum platforms more accessible and impactful than ever before. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Remote, US&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel:&lt;/strong&gt; 30%&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Job ID:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;nbsp;1899&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;IonQ is developing the world&#39;s most powerful full-stack quantum computer based on trapped-ion technology. We are pushing past the limits of classical physics and current supercomputing technology to unlock a new era of computing. Quantum computing has the potential to impact every area of human society for the better. IonQ&#39;s computers will soon redefine industries like medicine, materials science, finance, artificial intelligence, machine learning, cryptography, and more. IonQ is at the forefront of this technological revolution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Customer Success Manager, Quantum Adoption &amp;amp; Technical Enablement to join a dynamic, cross-functional team dedicated to driving IonQ&#39;s mission of delivering exceptional experiences for our customers. In this role, you will be IonQ&#39;s primary customer-facing technical expert, going hands-on with customers to drive real adoption of our trapped-ion quantum computers. You will bridge deep platform and quantum-algorithm expertise with customer empathy, guiding organizations through performance optimization, circuit design, and workflow integration as they build on IonQ&#39;s platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a trusted technical advisor, this position offers a high-visibility opportunity to influence and inspire highly technical internal and external stakeholders, ensuring they have the best possible experience on our platform. Scientific expertise and hands-on credibility, combined with exceptional communication skills, are essential for success in this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Onboarding &amp;amp; Platform Mastery: &lt;/strong&gt;Facilitate adoption for major accounts by translating contract terms into technical provisioning, leading onboarding sessions, and managing day-to-day technical engagement operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Optimization &amp;amp; Circuit Design: &lt;/strong&gt;Leverage expertise in optimization, machine learning, and chemistry/materials simulation to guide customers on best practices for designing quantum circuits, applications, and workflows, in close collaboration with quantum compiler and system experts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Support &amp;amp; Blocker Removal: &lt;/strong&gt;Standardize troubleshooting workflows for job failures, establish Customer Success team best practices, and provide direct, high-touch technical support to remove barriers to adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curriculum &amp;amp; Enablement Content: &lt;/strong&gt;Expand IonQ&#39;s user base by identifying real-world challenges for industry customers and creating workshops, challenges, and curricula, including code, circuits, slides, and videos, that empower them to learn and apply quantum computing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Advocacy: &lt;/strong&gt;Act as the primary internal advocate for user perspective across Product, Cloud Platform, Data Engineering, and Ops, on topics ranging from specific UI/UX design to high-level platform architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven Customer Health: &lt;/strong&gt;Design and maintain dashboards tracking job metrics, system usage, and overall customer health, and leverage usage data to provide actionable technical intelligence to internal teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;External Technical Representation: &lt;/strong&gt;Represent IonQ on standards bodies, government committees, quantum working groups, industry panels, and other relevant forums, leading technical sessions and workshops at industry conferences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Technical Alignment: &lt;/strong&gt;Collaborate with Product Management, Product Marketing, Sales, and Engineering teams to provide technical customer insights on product functionality, documentation, and educational materials, and refine term-sheet language to align customer expectations with technical capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master&#39;s or PhD in Physics, Computer Science, Machine Learning, Operations Research, or a related STEM field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in technical customer-facing roles or equivalent, with a proven track record of performance and goal achievement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience creating customer-facing technical content such as training material, success plans, playbooks, and workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Python and quantum frameworks such as Qiskit, Cirq, PennyLane, CUDA-Q, or other quantum computing SDKs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of Jupyter Notebook, Google Colab, or similar platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of key physics concepts and mathematical techniques relevant to quantum computing, including linear algebra and probability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional technical and executive presentation skills, with the ability to influence and inspire audiences ranging from researchers and end-users to C-suite executives, all with varying levels of quantum knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to teach complex topics to diverse audiences, tailoring curricula to customer needs, including large lectures, smaller study sessions, and one-on-one mentoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-depth knowledge of the strengths and weaknesses of various quantum computing hardware platforms, with a solid understanding of quantum hardware-software dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience in quantum information science, applications, and algorithms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with SaaS platforms, REST APIs, and/or HPC systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in SQL; experience in data science or data analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with subscription-based and renewal business models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to engage in technical and business discussions with professionals across diverse domains, including finance, pharmaceuticals/healthcare, chemistry, computer vision, and operations research.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This position can have periods of occasional travel to customer sites and conferences, with evening/off-hours meetings as needed to support global customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;The total compensation package includes base, bonus, equity, and a range of benefit options found on our career site.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;If this role has a commission structure, the compensation range below just reflects the base compensation range.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Wage Transparency:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$112,800&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$141,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation will vary based on individual factors such as education, qualifications, and experience of the final candidate(s), specific office location, and calibration against relevant market data and internal team equity. Posted base salary figures are subject to change as new market data becomes available. Our benefits include comprehensive medical, dental, and vision plans, matching 401(k), unlimited PTO and paid holidays, parental/adoption leave, legal insurance, and a home technology stipend. Details of participation in these benefit plans will be provided when a candidate receives an offer of employment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At IonQ, we believe in fair treatment, access, opportunity, and advancement for all while striving to identify and eliminate barriers. We empower employees to thrive by fostering a culture of autonomy, productivity, and respect. We are dedicated to creating an environment where individuals can feel welcomed, respected, supported, and valued.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We are committed to equity and justice. We welcome different voices and viewpoints and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, ancestry, physical and/or mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, age, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, or any other basis protected by law. We are proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;The position you are applying for will require access to technology that is subject to U.S. export control and government contract restrictions.&amp;nbsp; Employment with IonQ is contingent on either verifying “U.S. Person” (e.g., U.S. citizen, U.S. national, U.S. permanent resident, or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum) status for export controls and government contracts work, obtaining any necessary license, and/or confirming the availability of a license exception under U.S. export controls.&amp;nbsp; Please note that in the absence of confirming you are a U.S. Person for export control and government contracts work purposes, IonQ may choose not to apply for a license or decline to use a license exception (if available) for you to access export-controlled technology that may require authorization, and similarly, you may not qualify for government contracts work that requires U.S. Persons, and IonQ may decline to proceed with your application on those bases alone.&amp;nbsp; Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Non-Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Due to applicable export control laws and regulations, candidates must be a U.S. citizen or national, U.S. permanent resident (i.e., current Green Card holder), or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum. Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are interested in being a part of our team and mission, we encourage you to apply!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About IonQ:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2F&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=IonQ%2C+Inc&amp;amp;index=7&amp;amp;md5=0818ffbedc6dbad8c4d1611ac94c2a0f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;IonQ, Inc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;. [NYSE: IONQ] is the world’s leading quantum platform and merchant supplier - delivering integrated quantum solutions across computing, networking, sensing, and security. IonQ’s newest generation of quantum computers, the IonQ Tempo, is the latest in a line of cutting-edge systems that have been helping customers and partners including &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=Amazon+Web+Services%2C&amp;amp;index=8&amp;amp;md5=a7f94ee9b71a392dca3cd6c413722e51&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Amazon Web Services, &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=and&amp;amp;index=9&amp;amp;md5=2bed627b388878763f41ffe0e4edb16c&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;and &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=AstraZeneca&amp;amp;index=10&amp;amp;md5=757c1f2c2ec94cf3982700106122164f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AstraZeneca&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt; achieve 20x performance results and accelerate innovation in drug discovery, materials science, financial modeling, logistics, cybersecurity, and defense. In 2025, the company achieved 99.99% two-qubit gate fidelity, &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-achieves-landmark-result-setting-new-world-record-in-quantum-computing&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=setting+a+world+record+in+quantum+computing+performance&amp;amp;index=11&amp;amp;md5=32e9cb88afbd439026a352666cc72c91&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;setting a world record in quantum computing performance&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Headquartered in College Park, Maryland, IonQ has operations in California, Colorado, Massachusetts, Tennessee, Washington, Italy, South Korea, Sweden, Switzerland, Canada, and the United Kingdom. Our quantum computing services are available through all major cloud providers, while we also meet the needs of networking and sensing customers across land, sea, air, and space. IonQ is making quantum platforms more accessible and impactful than ever before. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Role Overview&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Role:&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Customer Success Manager, Quantum Adoption &amp;amp; Technical Enablement to join a dynamic, cross functional team dedicated to driving IonQ&#39;s mission of delivering exceptional experiences for our customers. In this role, you will be IonQ&#39;s primary customer facing technical expert, going hands on with customers to drive real adoption of our trapped ion quantum computers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You will bridge deep platform and quantum algorithm expertise with customer empathy, guiding organisations through performance optimisation, circuit design and workflow integration as they build on IonQ&#39;s platform. As a trusted technical advisor, this position offers a high visibility opportunity to influence and inspire highly technical internal and external stakeholders, ensuring they have the best possible experience on our platform. Scientific expertise and hands on credibility, combined with exceptional communication skills, are central to success in this role.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;You will facilitate adoption for major accounts, from translating contract terms into technical provisioning through to leading onboarding and managing day to day technical engagement. You will guide customers on best practice for quantum circuits, applications and workflows, working closely with quantum compiler and system experts, and remove the barriers that stand between a customer and real use of the platform.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You will also act as the primary internal advocate for the user perspective across Product, Cloud Platform, Data Engineering and Ops, on topics ranging from specific UI and UX design to high level platform architecture. You will collaborate with Product Management, Product Marketing, Sales and Engineering to share technical customer insight on product functionality, documentation and educational material, and help refine term sheet language so customer expectations align with technical capability.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Externally, you will represent IonQ on standards bodies, government committees, quantum working groups, industry panels and other relevant forums, leading technical sessions and workshops at industry conferences. The role includes travel to customer sites and conferences, with evening or off hours meetings as needed to support global customers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Key responsibilities include:&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Technical onboarding and platform mastery: lead onboarding sessions and manage day to day technical engagement for major accounts.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Performance optimisation and circuit design: apply expertise in optimisation, machine learning and chemistry or materials simulation to guide customer circuits, applications and workflows.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Technical support and blocker removal: standardise troubleshooting workflows for job failures, set Customer Success best practice and provide direct, high touch support.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Curriculum and enablement content: create workshops, challenges and curricula, including code, circuits, slides and videos, built around real world industry challenges.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Data driven customer health: design and maintain dashboards tracking job metrics, system usage and customer health, and turn usage data into actionable technical intelligence.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Requirements:&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;You will hold a Master&#39;s or PhD in Physics, Computer Science, Machine Learning, Operations Research or a related STEM field, with a strong understanding of the physics concepts and mathematical techniques relevant to quantum computing, including linear algebra and probability. You will bring 5+ years of experience in technical customer facing roles or equivalent, with a proven track record of performance and goal achievement, and 3+ years creating customer facing technical content such as training material, success plans, playbooks and workflows.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You will have working knowledge of Jupyter Notebook, Google Colab or similar platforms, and a proven ability to teach complex topics to diverse audiences, tailoring curricula to customer needs across large lectures, smaller study sessions and one to one mentoring. Demonstrated experience in quantum information science, applications and algorithms is an advantage, as is familiarity with subscription and renewal business models and the ability to hold technical and business discussions across domains such as finance, pharmaceuticals and healthcare, chemistry, computer vision and operations research.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;You’d be a great fit with:&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Hands on experience with Python and quantum frameworks such as Qiskit, Cirq, PennyLane, CUDA Q or other quantum computing SDKs.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Exceptional technical and executive presentation skills, influencing audiences from researchers and end users to C suite executives.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;In depth knowledge of the strengths and weaknesses of different quantum computing hardware platforms and their hardware and software dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Experience with SaaS platforms, REST APIs or HPC systems.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in SQL and experience in data science or data analytics.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;The total compensation package includes base salary, bonus, equity, and a range of benefits available on our career site.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation will vary based on individual factors such as education, qualifications, and experience of the final candidate(s), specific office location, and calibration against relevant market data and internal team equity. Posted base salary figures are subject to change as new market data becomes available. Our benefits include comprehensive medical, dental, and vision plans, matching 401(k), unlimited PTO and paid holidays, parental/adoption leave, legal insurance, and a home technology stipend. Details of participation in these benefit plans will be provided when a candidate receives an offer of employment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At IonQ, we believe in fair treatment, access, opportunity, and advancement for all while striving to identify and eliminate barriers. We empower employees to thrive by fostering a culture of autonomy, productivity, and respect. We are dedicated to creating an environment where individuals can feel welcomed, respected, supported, and valued.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We are committed to equity and justice. We welcome different voices and viewpoints and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, ancestry, physical and/or mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, age, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, or any other basis protected by law. We are proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;The position you are applying for will require access to technology that is subject to U.S. export control and government contract restrictions.&amp;nbsp; Employment with IonQ is contingent on either verifying “U.S. Person” (e.g., U.S. citizen, U.S. national, U.S. permanent resident, or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum) status for export controls and government contracts work, obtaining any necessary license, and/or confirming the availability of a license exception under U.S. export controls.&amp;nbsp; Please note that in the absence of confirming you are a U.S. Person for export control and government contracts work purposes, IonQ may choose not to apply for a license or decline to use a license exception (if available) for you to access export-controlled technology that may require authorization, and similarly, you may not qualify for government contracts work that requires U.S. Persons, and IonQ may decline to proceed with your application on those bases alone.&amp;nbsp; Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Non-Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Due to applicable export control laws and regulations, candidates must be a U.S. citizen or national, U.S. permanent resident (i.e., current Green Card holder), or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum. Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are interested in being a part of our team and mission, we encourage you to apply!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About IonQ:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2F&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=IonQ%2C+Inc&amp;amp;index=7&amp;amp;md5=0818ffbedc6dbad8c4d1611ac94c2a0f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;IonQ, Inc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;. [NYSE: IONQ] is the world’s leading quantum platform and merchant supplier - delivering integrated quantum solutions across computing, networking, sensing, and security. IonQ’s newest generation of quantum computers, the IonQ Tempo, is the latest in a line of cutting-edge systems that have been helping customers and partners including &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=Amazon+Web+Services%2C&amp;amp;index=8&amp;amp;md5=a7f94ee9b71a392dca3cd6c413722e51&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Amazon Web Services, &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=and&amp;amp;index=9&amp;amp;md5=2bed627b388878763f41ffe0e4edb16c&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;and &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=AstraZeneca&amp;amp;index=10&amp;amp;md5=757c1f2c2ec94cf3982700106122164f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AstraZeneca&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt; achieve 20x performance results and accelerate innovation in drug discovery, materials science, financial modeling, logistics, cybersecurity, and defense. In 2025, the company achieved 99.99% two-qubit gate fidelity, &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-achieves-landmark-result-setting-new-world-record-in-quantum-computing&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=setting+a+world+record+in+quantum+computing+performance&amp;amp;index=11&amp;amp;md5=32e9cb88afbd439026a352666cc72c91&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;setting a world record in quantum computing performance&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Headquartered in College Park, Maryland, IonQ has operations in California, Colorado, Massachusetts, Tennessee, Washington, Italy, South Korea, Sweden, Switzerland, Canada, and the United Kingdom. Our quantum computing services are available through all major cloud providers, while we also meet the needs of networking and sensing customers across land, sea, air, and space. IonQ is making quantum platforms more accessible and impactful than ever before. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; This role can work onsite or hybrid from our College Park, MD.&amp;nbsp; We are open to a fully remote option for the right candidate.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel:&lt;/strong&gt; Up to 10%&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Job ID:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;nbsp;1651&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Senior Director, Revenue, a new leadership role at IonQ. This is a high-impact position responsible for the integrity of our global revenue lifecycle. Reporting to the VP, Global Controller, you will build and lead a specialized revenue team through the complexities of hardware builds, government contracting, and commercial and manufacturing scale. You will be a strategic partner to Finance, Sales, and Legal leadership, helping architect the deals and the team that will power the quantum future. Your work will be central to our mission of building the world&#39;s best quantum computers to solve the world&#39;s most complex problems, transforming business, society, and the planet for the better.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect Revenue Strategy &amp;amp; Policy: Serve as a primary technical advisor to Sales, Deal Desk, and Legal during contract negotiations, optimizing commercial terms across quantum products and manufacturing streams in alignment with ASC 606 and company objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build &amp;amp; Lead the Team: Build and lead a high-performing revenue team, including Manager- and Senior Manager-level staff, establishing structure, hiring plans, and career pathing as the team grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own Complex Accounting: Hold ownership of revenue recognition for complex, multi-year hardware builds and manufacturing environments, including percentage-of-completion (POC) accounting, cost-to-cost models, and estimate-at-completion (EAC) reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Functional Partnership: Serve as the bridge between Finance and Operations, ensuring engineering milestones and supply chain costs translate into accurate, defensible revenue recognition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SOX &amp;amp; Governance: Own the relationship with external auditors on revenue recognition matters, including technical memos and audit/SOX-ready documentation; prepare materials on revenue positions for Audit Committee or executive review as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;M&amp;amp;A &amp;amp; Integration Leadership: Serve as the revenue lead for M&amp;amp;A activities, performing pre-acquisition due diligence on revenue streams and owning post-acquisition integration of acquired contracts into IonQ&#39;s global ASC 606 policies and systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;System Innovation: Partner with IT and Business Applications leadership to optimize ERP (NetSuite) and CRM infrastructure, driving automation of revenue recognition and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;13+ years of progressive accounting/finance experience, including several years operating at the Director or Senior Director level owning a revenue or technical accounting function within a publicly traded technology, aerospace/defense, or hardware manufacturing company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience leading a team of Managers and/or Senior Managers, with accountability for a growing, multi-person revenue function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in ASC 606, including multiple element arrangements, point-in-time and over-time revenue recognition criteria, and cost-to-cost input models for long-term builds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record scaling a revenue function, including integration of acquired companies and automation of manual revenue processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to advise and influence Sales, Legal, and Finance leadership, translating complex accounting standards into actionable business guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in cost-to-cost modeling and project-level data analysis to ensure accurate revenue forecasting and recognition across a growing portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Accounting or Finance; CPA license required. MBA or advanced degree an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior Director-level or above experience at a top semiconductor or computing component company or Tier 1 government contractor (e.g., Lockheed Martin, Northrop Grumman, Leidos, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Big 4 public accounting background within audit or technical accounting advisory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with quantum computing and a demonstrated interest and ability to learn technical concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;The approximate base salary range for this position is &lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;$220,000 to $275,000&lt;/span&gt;. The total compensation package includes base, bonus, equity, and a range of benefit options found on our career site.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation will vary based on individual factors such as education, qualifications, and experience of the final candidate(s), specific office location, and calibration against relevant market data and internal team equity. Posted base salary figures are subject to change as new market data becomes available. Our benefits include comprehensive medical, dental, and vision plans, matching 401(k), unlimited PTO and paid holidays, parental/adoption leave, legal insurance, and a home technology stipend. Details of participation in these benefit plans will be provided when a candidate receives an offer of employment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At IonQ, we believe in fair treatment, access, opportunity, and advancement for all while striving to identify and eliminate barriers. We empower employees to thrive by fostering a culture of autonomy, productivity, and respect. We are dedicated to creating an environment where individuals can feel welcomed, respected, supported, and valued.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We are committed to equity and justice. We welcome different voices and viewpoints and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, ancestry, physical and/or mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, age, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, or any other basis protected by law. We are proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;
