&lt;li&gt;Review and verify supplier&amp;nbsp;end item data packages&amp;nbsp;including Certificates of Conformance (CoCs), as built BOMs, electrical test reports,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;X-rays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and document non conformances, segregate suspect material, and initiate supplier corrective action requests (SCARs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain&amp;nbsp;accurate&amp;nbsp;inspection records and ensure traceability of materials according to AS9100 and customer requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Engineering and Manufacturing teams to resolve discrepancies prior to qualification and customer submission&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support internal and external audits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in manufacturing computer system to record inspections, move parts through inspection queues, and generate nonconformance report requests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement and&amp;nbsp;maintain&amp;nbsp;a calibrated tool system and process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
