rug discovery, materials science, financial modeling, logistics, cybersecurity, and defense. In 2025, the company achieved 99.99% two-qubit gate fidelity, &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-achieves-landmark-result-setting-new-world-record-in-quantum-computing&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=setting+a+world+record+in+quantum+computing+performance&amp;amp;index=11&amp;amp;md5=32e9cb88afbd439026a352666cc72c91&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;setting a world record in quantum computing performance&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Headquartered in College Park, Maryland, IonQ has operations in California, Colorado, Massachusetts, Tennessee, Washington, Italy, South Korea, Sweden, Switzerland, Canada, and the United Kingdom. Our quantum computing services are available through all major cloud providers, while we also meet the needs of networking and sensing customers across land, sea, air, and space. IonQ is making quantum platforms more accessible and impactful than ever before. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; This role will work onsite at our office located in Boston, MA, with flexibility to be remote a few days a week.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel:&lt;/strong&gt; Up to 20%, domestic.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Job ID:&lt;/strong&gt; 1736&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;IonQ&#39;s Quantum Memories team is looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Lead Technical Strategist / Solutions Architect&lt;/strong&gt; to help bridge deep technical R&amp;amp;D with our commercial go-to-market strategy. You&#39;ll translate cutting-edge quantum networking, sensing, and compute technology into clear value propositions for customers — while feeding customer insight back into our internal roadmap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-visibility, individual-contributor role for someone who&#39;s equally comfortable in a room with physicists, government program managers, and enterprise executives. It&#39;s technical sales and strategy, not commissioned sales — you&#39;ll be judged on deal progression, roadmap impact, and customer trust, not quota.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build go-to-market assets that clearly explain the unique capabilities of IonQ&#39;s integrated quantum networking, sensing, and compute systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the sales team to move customers through the funnel, leading technical discussions that explore use-case fit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally with engineering, R&amp;amp;D, and program management to represent customer needs accurately and ensure delivery aligns with what was promised&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Channel customer and market feedback into technology roadmap planning, helping leadership prioritize what gets built next&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted technical voice for both external stakeholders and internal teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional experience (industry, consulting, applied research, or equivalent)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong grounding in the fundamentals of quantum physics — this can come from a PhD in the physical sciences &lt;em&gt;or&lt;/em&gt; equivalent hands-on industry/technical experience. A dedicated quantum science background is not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years in an industry setting, including 1+ years in an external/customer-facing capacity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to flex between deeply technical and executive-level audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing projects and stakeholders across internal and external parties&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in management consulting, venture capital, technical sales, or similar customer-facing technical roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across multiple functions — R&amp;amp;D, sales, marketing, pricing, or product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort building financial models, ROI analyses, or business cases to support customer or internal decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience in quantum information science and technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of identifying and communicating market gaps and opportunities to leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to synthesize varied customer feedback into a coherent point of view that shapes technology direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The approximate base salary range for this position is $&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;126,887&lt;/span&gt; - $&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;166,127&lt;/span&gt;. The total compensation package includes base, bonus, equity, and a range of benefit options found on our career site.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation will vary based on individual factors such as education, qualifications, and experience of the final candidate(s), specific office location, and calibration against relevant market data and internal team equity. Posted base salary figures are subject to change as new market data becomes available. Our benefits include comprehensive medical, dental, and vision plans, matching 401(k), unlimited PTO and paid holidays, parental/adoption leave, legal insurance, and a home technology stipend. Details of participation in these benefit plans will be provided when a candidate receives an offer of employment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At IonQ, we believe in fair treatment, access, opportunity, and advancement for all while striving to identify and eliminate barriers. We empower employees to thrive by fostering a culture of autonomy, productivity, and respect. We are dedicated to creating an environment where individuals can feel welcomed, respected, supported, and valued.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We are committed to equity and justice. We welcome different voices and viewpoints and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, ancestry, physical and/or mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, age, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, or any other basis protected by law. We are proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
